{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a triangle in a hand-drawn world. Roll around and encounter other triangles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden platforms are your best friend. They will always get you to where you want to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, sometimes they need to be persuaded by a nearby button or lever...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must you be confined to remaining a triangle? Certainly not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the power to change your shape simply by picking up additional line segments or dropping ones you currently have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changing your segment count will be useful as you travel across the land...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes of different sizes and colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures from scanned sheets of paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special level that can be completed in around 20 minutes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056100?t=1759251719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056100/dadbbc98f510099f31b6edd84d29ea3d57e4570e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759251719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056100/d47e22f0a97bef91067b9e18fa25845893628324/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759251719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056100/d47e22f0a97bef91067b9e18fa25845893628324/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759251719","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},